    "Owner": "NLM",
    "CoiStatement": "Compliance with ethical standards This study was part of a multicenter randomized controlled clinical trial investigating the efficacy of CBCT prior to mandibular third molar removal from which the trial and the clinical protocol were approved by the Institutional Review Board (CCMO Arnhem-Nijmegen, NL nr.: 40492.091.12). Conflict of interest The authors declare that they have no conflict of interest. Funding The work was supported by the Department of Oral & Maxillofacial Surgery of Radboud University Medical Centre. The BOOA Research Foundation of the Dutch Society of the Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery furthermore supported this study. Informed consent All patients were informed about the study and a written informed consent was obtained.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "71-83"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
